{"overview":{"Symbol":"PLBL","Name":"Polibeli Group Ltd","Description":"Polibeli Group Ltd provides digital supply chain and distribution-sales services in Japan, Indonesia, Hongkong, Europe, and internationally. It offers solutions, including products procurement, channel distribution, warehousing and logistics services, brand operations, and digital marketing services to upstream and downstream business partners. The company also offers consumer electronic accessories, household appliances, skincare products, oral-care products, cosmetics products, maternity and baby products, toys and game products, health-care products, watches and accessories, and other products. In addition, it provides sales promotion services, as well as goods trading. Further, the company operates Polibeli Platform, including Polibeli App that offers a one-stop procurement solution to small and medium-sized retailers; and Polisales App, a mobile app that targets sales representatives. Additionally, it offers integrated digital supply chain services platform to retailers, suppliers, brand owners, and supply chain industry. The company is based in Singapore.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGM","Currency":"USD","Country":"Singapore","Sector":"Consumer Cyclical","Industry":"Department Stores","Address":"Suntec Tower 3, Singapore, 038988, Singapore","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"2234963456","EBITDA":"-7381974","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"-0.124","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-0.02","RevenuePerShareTTM":"0.073","ProfitMargin":"-0.22597","OperatingMarginTTM":"-0.24701001","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.24496001","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"","RevenueTTM":"26419714","GrossProfitTTM":"1940573","DilutedEPSTTM":"-0.02","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.611","AnalystTargetPrice":"","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"84.594536","PriceToBookRatio":"","EVToRevenue":"84.237","EVToEBITDA":"-301.48","Beta":"","52Week